 Provide **very high data speed and capacity**.

 ### Examples

 - 4K video
- 8K video
- AR — Augmented Reality
- VR — Virtual Reality
- Smart homes
- Smart offices
- Fast downloads

 ### RAN requirements

 - Wide bandwidth
- Sub-6 GHz
- mmWave
- Massive MIMO
- Beamforming

 ### Main priority

 > **High speed**

 It is more concerned with high throughput than extremely low latency.

 ### Easy memory

