 ### Massive MIMO divides resources in:

 - **Space**

 Therefore:

 > **5G can manage resources in time \+ frequency + space.**

 ### Result

 - More users
- Higher capacity
- Better coverage
- Better cell-edge performance
- Support for different services

 ### Easy memory

 > **OFDMA = Time + Frequency**\
>  **Massive MIMO = Space**

